# Duplicated layout rules

This site repeats header and footer markup directly in each HTML page.

Known current pages:

- index.html
- sessions.html
- faq.html
- team.html
- reviews.html
- contact.html
- join.html
- donations.html
- raffle.html

## Header and navigation changes

If changing the header, navigation, logo area, mobile menu, or nav links:

1. inspect all HTML pages first
2. identify all repeated header versions
3. apply the same intentional change consistently across pages
4. preserve relative links
5. preserve mobile menu markup and behavior
6. confirm the mobile nav still matches the JavaScript expectations

Do not update only one page unless explicitly requested.

## Footer changes

If changing footer links or footer content:

1. inspect all repeated footer versions
2. update consistently across pages
3. preserve existing contact, donation, and social links unless asked to change them

## Adding pages

When adding a new public page:

- include the same header/footer structure as existing pages
- add the page to navigation only if requested or clearly appropriate
- link to the page from relevant existing pages
- avoid creating empty placeholder pages
- update any known page lists if they exist